---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="拦截与改写能力" description="每种改写能力的最小可用示例">
  <h1>拦截与改写能力</h1>

  <p>本页列出 RelayCore 内置的流量改写能力，每项配一个能通过 <code>relay-core-cli rules validate</code> 的 Rule JSON（也可直接 <code>PUT /api/v1/rules</code>）。字段形状与 <a href="/docs/rule-engine">规则 API</a> 一致：<code>active</code>、<code>stage</code>、<code>termination</code>、带 <code>type</code> 的 <code>filter</code>，以及 <code>actions</code> 数组。动作字段包在 <code>config</code> 里。</p>

  <h2 id="mock-response">Mock Response</h2>
  <p>用本地假响应替换上游响应。常用于前端开发、契约测试、错误模拟。在请求头阶段终止，不再访问上游。</p>
  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "mock-health",
  "name": "Mock /v1/health",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "RequestHeaders",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Stop",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "Path", "config": &#123; "mode": "Exact", "value": "/v1/health" &#125; &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123;
    "type": "MockResponse",
    "config": &#123;
      "status": 200,
      "headers": &#123; "content-type": "application/json" &#125;,
      "body": &#123; "type": "Text", "value": "&#123;\\"ok\\":true&#125;" &#125;
    &#125;
  &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h2 id="map-local">Map Local</h2>
  <p>把 HTTP 请求替换成本地文件。常用于前端联调、离线调试。路径必须落在策略的 sandbox 根目录内。</p>
  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "map-local-static",
  "name": "Serve /static from disk",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "RequestHeaders",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Stop",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "Path", "config": &#123; "mode": "Prefix", "value": "/static/" &#125; &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123;
    "type": "MapLocal",
    "config": &#123; "path": "/Users/me/projects/app/static", "content_type": null &#125;
  &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h2 id="map-remote">Map Remote</h2>
  <p>把请求改写到另一个地址。常用于把生产流量切到预发。</p>
  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "map-remote-prod-to-staging",
  "name": "api.example.com -&gt; staging",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "RequestHeaders",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Stop",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "Host", "config": &#123; "mode": "Exact", "value": "api.example.com" &#125; &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123;
    "type": "MapRemote",
    "config": &#123; "url": "https://api-staging.example.com", "preserve_host": false &#125;
  &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h2 id="redirect">Redirect</h2>
  <p>返回 3xx 重定向。</p>
  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "redirect-legacy",
  "name": "/old -&gt; /new",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "RequestHeaders",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Stop",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "Path", "config": &#123; "mode": "Exact", "value": "/old" &#125; &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123;
    "type": "Redirect",
    "config": &#123; "location": "https://example.com/new", "status": 301 &#125;
  &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h2 id="header-modification">Header 改写</h2>
  <p>增删改请求/响应头。<code>UpdateRequestHeader</code> / <code>UpdateResponseHeader</code> 的 <code>value</code> 支持 <code>&#123;&#123;previous&#125;&#125;</code>，引用改写前的值。</p>
  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "strip-cookie",
  "name": "Strip Set-Cookie on /api/*",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "ResponseHeaders",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Continue",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "Path", "config": &#123; "mode": "Prefix", "value": "/api/" &#125; &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123; "type": "DeleteResponseHeader", "config": &#123; "name": "set-cookie" &#125; &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "add-debug",
  "name": "Add X-Debug header",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "RequestHeaders",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Continue",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "Method", "config": &#123; "mode": "Exact", "value": "POST" &#125; &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123;
    "type": "AddRequestHeader",
    "config": &#123; "name": "x-debug", "value": "relay-core" &#125;
  &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h2 id="body-modification">Body 改写</h2>
  <p>支持整体替换、正则替换、JSONPath 修改。依赖 body 的规则必须放在 <code>RequestBody</code> / <code>ResponseBody</code> 阶段；超过检查预算的 body 会被跳过并打上原因，不会在截断前缀上匹配。</p>
  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "jsonpath-set",
  "name": "Force user.role = admin",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "RequestBody",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Continue",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "Host", "config": &#123; "mode": "Exact", "value": "api.example.com" &#125; &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123;
    "type": "TransformRequestBody",
    "config": &#123;
      "transform": &#123;
        "type": "JsonPathSet",
        "config": &#123; "path": "$.user.role", "value": "\\"admin\\"" &#125;
      &#125;
    &#125;
  &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "regex-replace",
  "name": "Replace token in body",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "ResponseBody",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Continue",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "Path", "config": &#123; "mode": "Exact", "value": "/login" &#125; &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123;
    "type": "TransformResponseBody",
    "config": &#123;
      "transform": &#123;
        "type": "RegexReplace",
        "config": &#123; "pattern": "secret=([^&amp;]+)", "replacement": "secret=REDACTED" &#125;
      &#125;
    &#125;
  &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h2 id="intercept-breakpoints">拦截断点</h2>
  <p>暂停实时流量等待人工决定。用 HTTP <code>POST /api/v1/intercepts</code> 或 MCP <code>set_intercept</code> 创建断点；<code>resume</code> / <code>resume_flow</code> 放行或丢弃。没有 <code>relay-core-cli intercept</code> 子命令。</p>

  <pre><code>curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/v1/intercepts \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '&#123;
    "url_pattern": "api.example.com",
    "phase": "request"
  &#125;'</code></pre>

  <p>断点命中时在 TUI <strong>Intercepts</strong> 面板可见，也可以通过 <code>GET /api/v1/intercepts</code> 查询。放行时可以携带修改。<code>request_header_upserts</code> / <code>response_header_upserts</code> 按名增改、保留其余头；<code>request_headers</code> / <code>response_headers</code> 会整表替换。</p>

  <pre><code>curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/v1/intercepts/&lt;key&gt;/resume \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '&#123;
    "action": "continue",
    "request_header_upserts": &#123; "x-test": "value" &#125;
  &#125;'</code></pre>

  <p>可修改字段：<code>method</code>、<code>url</code>、<code>request_headers</code>、<code>request_header_upserts</code>、<code>request_body</code>、<code>status_code</code>、<code>response_headers</code>、<code>response_header_upserts</code>、<code>response_body</code>、<code>message_content</code>（WebSocket）。</p>

  <h2 id="flow-replay">流量重放</h2>
  <p>把已捕获的 HTTP 请求再发一次。请求体被忽略，不能在这次重放里改头或改体；重放也不经过代理，因此不会再次被捕获、也不会跑规则。仅支持 HTTP，不支持 WebSocket。</p>
  <pre><code>curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/v1/flows/&lt;id&gt;/replay

# TLS 校验失败时（仅调试）
curl -X POST 'http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/v1/flows/&lt;id&gt;/replay?accept_invalid_certs=true'</code></pre>

  <h2>WebSocket 消息改写</h2>
  <p>WebSocket 流量有两个专用动作，阶段必须是 <code>WebSocketMessage</code>：</p>
  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "ws-mock",
  "name": "Mock chat messages",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "WebSocketMessage",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Stop",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "Host", "config": &#123; "mode": "Exact", "value": "chat.example.com" &#125; &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123;
    "type": "MockWebSocketMessage",
    "config": &#123;
      "direction": "Incoming",
      "message": "&#123;\\"type\\":\\"welcome\\",\\"user\\":\\"bot\\"&#125;"
    &#125;
  &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <p>也可以丢弃匹配到的消息：</p>
  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "ws-drop-pings",
  "name": "Drop ping frames",
  "active": true,
  "stage": "WebSocketMessage",
  "priority": 100,
  "termination": "Stop",
  "filter": &#123; "type": "All" &#125;,
  "actions": [&#123; "type": "DropWebSocketMessage" &#125;]
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h2>L3/L4 Action</h2>
  <p>这三个动作只在 <code>Connect</code> 阶段有意义：</p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>RedirectIp</code> — 把连接拨到另一个 IP</li>
    <li><code>ForwardPort</code> — 转发到另一个 host:port（主机名会解析）</li>
    <li><code>SetTtl</code> — 会被接受并记一条警告，线路上的 TTL 不变</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
